      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the current system of having a config file accessible outside of VRChat is the best, unless you want to somehow stop people from drinking in VR, it's better to not add certain things to the UI\n\nHave you sent https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500004572821-I-want-to-change-where-my-downloaded-content-cache-is-stored to your friend?",
