  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "My friend is rocking an old laptop with a 200GB C:/ Drive that's perpetually almost full and running Desktop VRChat fills the last remaining 13 gigabytes of storage space with reckless abandon. They had to clear VRChat cache because they couldn't install a 10mb VST\n\nAutodetection of nearly-full drives, easier to access config, or even an option to select which drive cache is on are options of varying complexity",
